Test fixtures
-------------

Parser fixtures under packages/sources are small, development-only captures
or synthetic samples used to test interoperability with publicly available
motorsport schedules and entry lists. Their original source and provenance are
documented in docs/SOURCES.md and in the corresponding adapters. Copyright and
trademark rights in source-page content remain with their respective owners.
The fixtures are not production data and fixture loading is refused when the
application runs in production mode.

